---
# Role-local ansible-lint config. Two pre-existing structural choices that we
# explicitly opt out of, both of which are non-runtime defects.
#
# 1) role-name: every role in this repo uses kebab-case (mnemonic-mcp,
#    telegram-ai-agent, ssh-hardening, fabric-services, ...). Renaming
#    `mnemonic-mcp` requires touching the playbook, every inventory
#    reference, every CI workflow grep, and the upstream role consumers.
#    Out of scope here; tracked as a repo-wide concern.
#
# 2) syntax-check[specific] on `molecule/default/converge.yml`: molecule
#    injects ANSIBLE_ROLES_PATH at runtime (`molecule test ...`), but
#    `ansible-lint` runs the playbook stand-alone and can't resolve the
#    role-by-name. The scenario isn't wired into CI as of 2026-06
#    (see role README TODO).
skip_list:
  - role-name

exclude_paths:
  - molecule/default/converge.yml
